              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 28.17-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Imbung'a osirua loo mukateni neitu eisuijieki, anaa apa enaaitanapa, ninya imukateni neitu eisuijieki too nkolong'i naapishana te nkolong natudung'oki olapa le Abibu amu te ninye apa itupukutuo aaing'uaa Misiri. Meetae oltung'ani olotu dukuya nanu too nkaik naarook. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
